Modified: converted by Omniweave's scripts/convert-esrgan.mjs to the LWT1 graph format (conv + PReLU fused, pixel
shuffle fused into the last conv); weights stored as fp16 with a 6-bit mantissa (general, wdn) and as int8 with one
scale per output channel (animevideov3). Files here:
